Package: opencnc3d
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: three-dimensional Command & Conquer
 OpenCNC3D is a Linux build of the launcher, the renderer and both game
 brains. The Command & Conquer data is not in this package. After the first
 start the launcher downloads the published module packages into the player's
 own data folder.
